If you are interested in joining us, sign up to the mailing list [here](#).

```=html
<form method="post" action="https://newsletter.zigtoberfest.de/subscription/form" class="listmonk-form">
  <div>
    <h3>Subscribe</h3>
    <input type="hidden" name="nonce">

    <p><input type="email" name="email" required placeholder="E-mail"></p>
    <p><input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Name (optional)"></p>

    <p>
      <input id="aa0d0" type="checkbox" name="l" checked value="aa0d01ac-b4fd-494b-9bef-cce03357cffb">
      <label for="aa0d0">EuroZig</label>
    </p>

    <altcha-widget challengeurl="https://newsletter.zigtoberfest.de/api/public/captcha/altcha"></altcha-widget>
    <script type="module" src="https://newsletter.zigtoberfest.de/public/static/altcha.umd.js" async></script>

    <input type="submit" value="Subscribe ">
  </div>
</form>
```
